flowchart TD
    enter[Site → Thiết lập bãi đỗ → Sơ đồ & Ô đỗ] --> scope{Allowed active site?}
    scope -->|No| deny[Safe shell + non-enumerating denial]
    scope -->|Yes| readiness[Readiness: zone, Overview source, calibration, history]
    readiness --> zone[Create or select Zone]
    zone --> source{Eligible Overview camera?}
    source -->|Online and capture supported| capture[Capture immutable snapshot]
    source -->|Missing/offline/capture unavailable| upload[Upload validated static image fallback]
    capture --> calibration[Place 4+ site-local control points]
    upload --> calibration
    calibration --> calibrationValid{Calibration valid?}
    calibrationValid -->|No| calibrationRecovery[Fix points, dimensions, or reprojection error]
    calibrationRecovery --> calibration
    calibrationValid -->|Yes| draft[Create versioned draft with lockVersion]
    draft --> editor[Draw slots: code + zone + enabled/disabled]
    editor --> liveValidation[Live client validation + debounced autosave]
    liveValidation --> conflict{Save conflict?}
    conflict -->|Yes| conflictRecovery[Stop autosave; compare, export local, or load server]
    conflictRecovery --> editor
    conflict -->|No| validate[Explicit site-wide server validation]
    validate --> valid{Valid across all camera partitions?}
    valid -->|No| errorPanel[Feature-linked geometry/code/coverage errors]
    errorPanel --> editor
    valid -->|Yes| preview[Unified site preview + occupancy overlay]
    preview --> publishReview[Publish summary: diff, slots, source, calibration, archived version]
    publishReview --> publish[Atomic idempotent publish + audit]
    publish --> runtime[Runtime reads published version only]
    runtime --> guard[Guard assigned-site view-only occupancy map]
    publish --> history[Version history]
    history --> rollbackReview[Compare archived target + enter reason]
    rollbackReview --> rollbackValidate{Compatible with current site?}
    rollbackValidate -->|No| rollbackBlocked[Keep current version active; show blockers]
    rollbackValidate -->|Yes| rollback[Atomic rollback + audit]
    rollback --> runtime
    history --> geojson[Export; import only into a new validated draft]
    geojson --> draft

    classDef error fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#b91c1c,color:#7f1d1d
    classDef warning fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#b45309,color:#78350f
    classDef success fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#15803d,color:#14532d
    class deny,calibrationRecovery,conflictRecovery,errorPanel,rollbackBlocked error
    class readiness,upload,publishReview,rollbackReview warning
    class publish,runtime,guard,rollback success

